OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FCold and cloudy in the morning  
OL,6,Fwith light patches of rain for Dorset  
OL,7,Fand Somerset. During the afternoon it  
OL,8,Fwill become breezy, and further rain   
OL,9,Fwill arrive in the southwest.          
OL,11,CTonight:FPatchy light rain to begin,   
OL,12,Fwith a band of heavy rain and gusty    
OL,13,Fwinds approaching the far west in the  
OL,14,Fearly hours. Feeling chilly overnight. 
OL,16,CTuesday:FA band of rain, often heavy   
OL,17,Fand with strong gusty winds stalls     
OL,18,Facross much of the region throughout   
OL,19,Fthe day before slowly easing by        
OL,20,Fevening. Easternmost areas may remain  
OL,21,Fdry.                                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
