OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:       
OL,6,FWednesday becoming more settled with   
OL,7,Fpatchy rain to begin, clearing into    
OL,8,FThursday with fine and dry conditions. 
OL,9,FFriday sees further bands of rain and  
OL,10,Fwinds increasing.                      
